  "remarks": "\nFormer so called ‘General Prosecutor’ of the so called ‘Luhansk People's Republic’ (until October 2017). Currently acting so-called ‘Minister of Justice’ of the so-called ‘Luhansk People’s Republic’. In taking on and acting in this capacity, he has therefore actively supported actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine and to further destabilise Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
